y people that get  stuck  in this reactive mode where they're just  every single thing that hits them like  oh and they're jumping here they're  jumping again they're jumping here  they never actually get anything done so  you as a busy entrepreneur is trying to  change the world and trying to create  products and businesses and companies  and and do all these things you can't  be jumping off every single thing you  have to have focus time you're able to  actually work and the biggest thing is  is breaking out your time where um you  no longer let people do  um reactive communication where you're  reacting all the time you have to focus  on the proactive so you shift things and  say okay this is the time i'm gonna  answer all the messages  if you have a question from you have to  send it to me in a way that i can answer  during this period of time  because i can't shift my focus i need to  be able to focus on  what i'm doing right here step number  nine maximize time with john maxwell  you see when you manage something you do  so to keep it going  well you don't need to keep time going  you don't even need to watch it you can  be completely aware well  unaware of it you can go to sleep  doesn't matter time just continually  moves it doesn't need you it doesn't  need me  it just keeps moving we don't need to do  time management because there's nothing  to manage it's automatic it continually  moves  what we need to do is priority  management  with the time that is continually  slipping away from us  we need to manage our priorities to  maximize  the time we have so don't  manage your time maximize your time  how by doing the things that are the  most important to do  at that moment make every day  your masterpiece and step number 10 the  last one before a very special bonus  clip  is break things down with jim quick  break things down  because a lot of people they don't do  this thing because this is amorphous  big elephant or big monster and what i  would say  that 